    </div><div class="prose-slot" lang="en"><p>The United States is the <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_countries_and_dependencies_by_area">third or fourth largest country</a> by total area,<sup class="ref"><button type="button"
        popovertarget="note-7"
        aria-label="Note 7">7</button></sup><sup class="ref"><button type="button"
        popovertarget="note-8"
        aria-label="Note 8">8</button></sup> with figures ranging between 3,717,813 and 3,809,525 square miles (9,629,091 and 9,866,624 km2).<sup class="ref"><button type="button"
        popovertarget="note-7"
        aria-label="Note 7">7</button></sup><sup class="ref"><button type="button"
        popovertarget="note-9"
        aria-label="Note 9">9</button></sup></p><a class="read" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_States#Geography">Geography ↗</a></div><div class="topic-articles"><div class="topic-article">
    <div class="body">
        <p class="source"><img src="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Wikipedia-logo-v2.svg?width=60" alt="" width="18"> en.wikipedia.org</p>
        <a class="title" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Geography_of_the_United_States" lang="en">Geography of the United States</a><p class="desc">overview of the geography of the United States of America</p></div><img class="pic k-photo"
     style="--a:1.6181"
     src="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Map%20of%20USA%20with%20state%20and%20territory%20names%202.png?width=330"
     alt=""
     loading="lazy"><span class="tools"><button class="info"
            type="button"
            popovertarget="p131"
            aria-label="Credit">i</button><span id="p131" popover class="pop">Wapcaplet · CC BY-SA 3.0</span></span></div></div></section>
