        popovertarget="note-23"
        aria-label="Note 23">23</button></sup> In August 2026, the total <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/National_debt_of_the_United_States">U.S. federal government debt</a> passed $40 trillion, having more than doubled in the previous decade.<sup class="ref"><button type="button"
        popovertarget="note-24"
