    <div id="note-10" popover class="pop cites" lang="en"><span class="note-text">This figure, like most official data for the United States as a whole, excludes the five unincorporated territories (<a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Puerto_Rico">Puerto Rico</a>, <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Guam">Guam</a>, the <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/U.S._Virgin_Islands">U.S. Virgin Islands</a>, <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/American_Samoa">American Samoa</a>, and the <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Northern_Mariana_Islands">Northern Mariana Islands</a>) and minor island possessions.</span></div>
